iQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"dclL14pr7OojCOKJ_ZbMbQ","review_id":"wSHRV1O6rFtQwb3makzJ2w","date":"2017-08-04T03:17:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9488422870635986,"text_excerpt":"My favorite bakery/gelateria ever. Friendly and family-owned, this place has a lot of history in addition to its charm and authenticity. (Check out the waterline by the door from Katrina.) All of the coffee served here is made using their custom-built one-of-a-kind espresso machines (which make incredible espresso, by the way). My go-to is a Napoleon pastry and a cappuccino, but I haven't had anything I didn't like! The almond crescent, spumoni cheesecake, and tiramisu are other favorites, and their gelato and Italian ice are wonderfully flavorful. I have yet to find a better cannoli this side of the Atlantic. You can fill them yourself if you get a cannoli kit to bring home. We love havi..."},{"business_id":"dclL14pr7OojCOKJ_ZbMbQ","review_id":"JDjH-9Ssjfo4WmHgeloBdg","date":"2012-08-17T10:46:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9413066506385803,"text_excerpt":"I am not the first to say this place is amazing, and I won't be the last. The gelato here is amazing- I had the Praline flavored one, and I think the people with me were jealous that I ordered it when I let them try (don't tell them though). I ordered a few cannolis (chocolate and vanilla flavored) for the group, and wasn't as impressed as I remember in the past. The atmosphere is great here. They have little chairs with a heart-shaped design and cute round tables which make the experience that much better. Be sure to go."},{"business_id":"dclL14pr7OojCOKJ_ZbMbQ","review_id":"EzIw9nWbVMuNixQH8245ZA","date":"2014-10-25T16:37:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9394263029098511,"text_excerpt":"Angelo Brocato's is my favorite ice cream shop in the city. It epitomizes old New Orleans, imo. It's small, and there is often a wait, but you won't find a better canoli in town. I think their canoli are the match of the ones I ate in Pozzuoli, which were the best I had in Italy. The pastries are authentic Italian, and their cappuccino is excellent, too. The ice cream takes center stage though. I grew up on Angelo Brocato's spumoni, and so I feel a little nostalgia whenever I order it. You can buy it in the store, but it's more fun to sit in the shop and people watch while you eat. I think you're guaranteed to see someone you know stop in if you're a local. Of course their stracciatella i..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"dclL14pr7OojCOKJ_ZbMbQ","photo_id":"CA015qXWuyoxpE-rOBKaDg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CA015qXWuyoxpE-rOBKaDg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8725873231887817},{"business_id":"dclL14pr7OojCOKJ_ZbMbQ","photo_id":"pXPY1btmu6pc5jiq8ty7yg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/pXPY1btmu6pc5jiq8ty7yg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8339313864707947},{"business_id":"dclL14pr7OojCOKJ_ZbMbQ","photo_id":"azoKmTTxD2hRI3MWiH1qjw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/azoKmTTxD2hRI3MWiH1qjw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8144599199295044},{"business_id":"dclL14pr7OojCOKJ_ZbMbQ","photo_id":"EW-uxL5b92AwT-N7XHzZQg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/EW-uxL5b92AwT-N7XHzZQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8032864928245544},{"business_id":"dclL14pr7O